From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 22:26:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1545/3799] soh: rename D_8089B9F0 -> sWallHeights

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the home Y of each of the four wall segments; Init matches its own height against the list to learn which segment it is.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c   | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c
index f2ceea4be..d87900aa9 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c
@@ -37,7 +37,8 @@ const ActorInit Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe_InitVars = {
     NULL,
 };
 
-static s16 D_8089B9F0[4] = { 943, 1043, 1243, 1343 };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_8089B9F0: the home Y of each of the four wall segments; Init matches its own height against the list to learn which segment it is.
+static s16 sWallHeights[4] = { 943, 1043, 1243, 1343 };  // was D_8089B9F0 [LLM:HIGH]
 
 static s16 D_8089B9F8[4] = { -1, 1, -1, 1 };
 
@@ -115,14 +116,14 @@ void BgJyaZurerukabe_Init(Actor* thisx, PlayState* play) {
     BgJyaZurerukabe_InitDynaPoly(this, play, &gZurerukabeCol, DPM_UNK);
     Actor_ProcessInitChain(thisx, sInitChain);
 
-    for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_COUNT(D_8089B9F0); i++) {
-        if (fabsf(D_8089B9F0[i] - this->dyna.actor.home.pos.y) < 1.0f) {
+    for (i = 0; i < ARRAY_COUNT(sWallHeights); i++) {  // was D_8089B9F0 [LLM:HIGH]
+        if (fabsf(sWallHeights[i] - this->dyna.actor.home.pos.y) < 1.0f) {  // was D_8089B9F0 [LLM:HIGH]
             this->unk_168 = i;
             break;
         }
     }
 
-    if (i == ARRAY_COUNT(D_8089B9F0)) {
+    if (i == ARRAY_COUNT(sWallHeights)) {  // was D_8089B9F0 [LLM:HIGH]
         osSyncPrintf(VT_COL(RED, WHITE));
         osSyncPrintf("home pos が変更されたみたい(%s %d)(arg_data 0x%04x)\n", __FILE__, __LINE__,
                      this->dyna.actor.params);
